; Mode 7 (111), the default: each LED lit for the share of the last frame its
; input was high (0-32 of 32 polls), so a steady high is fully lit and a PWM
; input shows dimmed. Also clears the dice's roll step.
mode_7_display:
    8C91  BE 1C          ldw    X,$1C                      
    8C93  54             srlw   X                          
    8C94  54             srlw   X                          
